<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine central bank says peso normalising.</title>
<headline>Philippine central bank says peso normalising.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Wednesday the peso was showing signs of normalisation, and it had already started buying dollars again.</p>
<p>Central bank governor Gabriel Singson made the comments in a report to President Fidel Ramos.</p>
